{"id":"mahabharata-5-168","work":"mahabharata","part":5,"partName":"उद्योगपर्व","partNameEn":"Udyoga Parva","unit":168,"title":"अष्टषष्ट्यधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 168 · More Pandava warriors","summary":{"en":"Bhishma names Shikhandin, Dhrishtadyumna, the five Kekaya brothers, Dhrishtaketu, Kashi's king and many others in the Pandava host, with their strengths.","kn":"ಭೀಷ್ಮನು ಶಿಖಂಡಿ, ಧೃಷ್ಟದ್ಯುಮ್ನ, ಐವರು ಕೇಕಯ ಸಹೋದರರು, ಧೃಷ್ಟಕೇತು, ಕಾಶೀರಾಜ ಮತ್ತು ಪಾಂಡವಸೈನ್ಯದ ಇತರ ಅನೇಕರನ್ನು ಅವರ ಬಲದೊಂದಿಗೆ ಹೆಸರಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"भीष्म पाण्डव सेना में शिखण्डी, धृष्टद्युम्न, पाँच केकय भाइयों, धृष्टकेतु, काशी के राजा और अनेक अन्यों के नाम उनके बल सहित बताते हैं।","te":"భీష్ముడు పాండవసైన్యంలోని శిఖండి, ధృష్టద్యుమ్నుడు, ఐదుగురు కేకయ సోదరులు, ధృష్టకేతుడు, కాశీరాజు, అనేక ఇతరులను వారి బలాలతో పేర్కొంటాడు.","ta":"பீஷ்மர் பாண்டவப் படையிலுள்ள ஶிகண்டி, த்ருஷ்டத்யும்னன், ஐந்து கேகயச் சகோதரர்கள், த்ருஷ்டகேது, காஶி மன்னன் மற்றும் பலரை அவர்கள் வலிமையுடன் பெயரிடுகிறார்.","ml":"പാണ്ഡവസേനയിലെ ശിഖണ്ഡി, ധൃഷ്ടദ്യുമ്നൻ, അഞ്ചു കേകയ സഹോദരന്മാർ, ധൃഷ്ടകേതു, കാശിരാജാവ്, മറ്റു പലരും എന്നിവരെ അവരുടെ ശക്തിയോടെ ഭീഷ്മർ പട്ടികപ്പെടുത്തുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 5.168; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Jan 23 2024","sections":[{"title":"रथातिरथसंख्यापर्व","titleEn":"Rathatirathasankhya Parva (Counting the warriors)","verses":[{"text":"भीष्म उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Bhishma said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"पाञ्चालराजस्य सुतो राजन्परपुरंजयः ।\nशिखण्डी रथमुख्यो मे मतः पार्थस्य भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"The son of the Panchala king, conqueror of enemy cities, Shikhandin, I count the foremost chariot-warrior of Partha, Bharata."}},{"n":2,"text":"एष योत्स्यति संग्रामे नाशयन्पूर्वसंस्थितिम् ।\nपरं यशो विप्रथयंस्तव सेनासु भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"He will fight in battle, destroying the earlier order, and spread supreme fame in your armies, Bharata."}},{"n":3,"text":"एतस्य बहुलाः सेनाः पाञ्चालाश्च प्रभद्रकाः ।\nतेनासौ रथवंशेन महत्कर्म करिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"His troops are many, Panchalas and Prabhadrakas; with that line of chariots he will do a great deed."}},{"n":4,"text":"धृष्टद्युम्नश्च सेनानीः सर्वसेनासु भारत ।\nमतो मेऽतिरथो राजन्द्रोणशिष्यो महारथः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Dhrishtadyumna, the commander of all the armies, Bharata, I count an atiratha, king, a great chariot-warrior and Drona's pupil."}},{"n":5,"text":"एष योत्स्यति संग्रामे सूदयन्वै परान्रणे ।\nभगवानिव संक्रुद्धः पिनाकी युगसंक्षये ॥","meaning":{"en":"He will fight in battle, killing the enemy, like the lord Pinakin angry at the end of an age."}},{"n":6,"text":"एतस्य तद्रथानीकं कथयन्ति रणप्रियाः ।\nबहुत्वात्सागरप्रख्यं देवानामिव संयुगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those fond of war say that his chariot army, huge as the sea, is like that of the gods in battle."}},{"n":7,"text":"क्षत्रधर्मा तु राजेन्द्र मतो मेऽर्धरथो नृप ।\nधृष्टद्युम्नस्य तनयो बाल्यान्नातिकृतश्रमः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Kshatradharman, king of kings, I count a half chariot-warrior; Dhrishtadyumna's son has not worked hard, being a child."}},{"n":8,"text":"शिशुपालसुतो वीरश्चेदिराजो महारथः ।\nधृष्टकेतुर्महेष्वासः संबन्धी पाण्डवस्य ह ॥","meaning":{"en":"Dhrishtaketu, hero, Shishupala's son and king of Chedi, a great chariot-warrior and great archer, is a kinsman of the Pandava."}},{"n":9,"text":"एष चेदिपतिः शूरः सह पुत्रेण भारत ।\nमहारथेनासुकरं महत्कर्म करिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"This brave lord of Chedi, with his son, a great chariot-warrior, will do a great deed hard for others to do."}},{"n":10,"text":"क्षत्रधर्मरतो मह्यं मतः परपुरंजयः ।\nक्षत्रदेवस्तु राजेन्द्र पाण्डवेषु रथोत्तमः ।\nजयन्तश्चामितौजाश्च सत्यजिच्च महारथः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Kshatradeva, conqueror of enemy cities, devoted to Kshatriya duty, I count among the best chariot-warriors of the Pandavas, as also Jayanta, Amitaujas and the great chariot-warrior Satyajit."}},{"n":11,"text":"महारथा महात्मानः सर्वे पाञ्चालसत्तमाः ।\nयोत्स्यन्ते समरे तात संरब्धा इव कुञ्जराः ॥","meaning":{"en":"All these are great chariot-warriors, great-souled, the best of the Panchalas; they will fight in battle, dear one, like enraged elephants."}},{"n":12,"text":"अजो भोजश्च विक्रान्तौ पाण्डवेषु महारथौ ।\nपाण्डवानां सहायार्थे परं शक्त्या यतिष्यतः ।\nशीघ्रास्त्रौ चित्रयोद्धारौ कृतिनौ दृढविक्रमौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Aja and Bhoja, valiant great chariot-warriors among the Pandavas, will strive with all their power to help the Pandavas, swift with weapons, varied fighters, skilled and firm in valor."}},{"n":13,"text":"केकयाः पञ्च राजेन्द्र भ्रातरो युद्धदुर्मदाः ।\nसर्व एते रथोदाराः सर्वे लोहितकध्वजाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The five Kekaya brothers, king of kings, are fierce in battle; all are noble chariot-warriors, all with red banners."}},{"n":14,"text":"काशिकः सुकुमारश्च नीलो यश्चापरो नृपः ।\nसूर्यदत्तश्च शङ्खश्च मदिराश्वश्च नामतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Kashi king, Sukumara, Nila and another king, Suryadatta, Shankha and Madirashva by name,"}},{"n":15,"text":"सर्व एते रथोदाराः सर्वे चाहवलक्षणाः ।\nसर्वास्त्रविदुषः सर्वे महात्मानो मता मम ॥","meaning":{"en":"All these are noble chariot-warriors, all marked for battle, all knowers of every weapon, all great-souled in my judgment."}},{"n":16,"text":"वार्धक्षेमिर्महाराज रथो मम महान्मतः ।\nचित्रायुधश्च नृपतिर्मतो मे रथसत्तमः ।\nस हि संग्रामशोभी च भक्तश्चापि किरीटिनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Vardhakshemi, great king, I count a great chariot-warrior, and King Chitrayudha I count a best chariot-warrior; he adorns battle and is devoted to Arjuna."}},{"n":17,"text":"चेकितानः सत्यधृतिः पाण्डवानां महारथौ ।\nद्वाविमौ पुरुषव्याघ्रौ रथोदारौ मतौ मम ॥","meaning":{"en":"Chekitana and Satyadhriti are two great chariot-warriors of the Pandavas, two tigers among men, noble chariot-warriors in my view."}},{"n":18,"text":"व्याघ्रदत्तश्च राजेन्द्र चन्द्रसेनश्च भारत ।\nमतौ मम रथोदारौ पाण्डवानां न संशयः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Vyaghradatta and Chandrasena, king of kings, I count as noble chariot-warriors of the Pandavas, without doubt."}},{"n":19,"text":"सेनाबिन्दुश्च राजेन्द्र क्रोधहन्ता च नामतः ।\nयः समो वासुदेवेन भीमसेनेन चाभिभूः ।\nस योत्स्यतीह विक्रम्य समरे तव सैनिकैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Senabindu, king of kings, also called Krodhahanta, who equals Vasudeva and Bhimasena in overpowering, will fight bravely here against your soldiers."}},{"n":20,"text":"मां द्रोणं च कृपं चैव यथा संमन्यते भवान् ।\nतथा स समरश्लाघी मन्तव्यो रथसत्तमः ॥","meaning":{"en":"As you hold me, Drona and Kripa in esteem, so should that boaster in battle be regarded as a best chariot-warrior."}},{"n":21,"text":"काश्यः परमशीघ्रास्त्रः श्लाघनीयो रथोत्तमः ।\nरथ एकगुणो मह्यं मतः परपुरंजयः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Kashi king, very swift with weapons, is a praiseworthy best chariot-warrior; I count him a single-fold chariot-warrior, conqueror of enemy cities."}},{"n":22,"text":"अयं च युधि विक्रान्तो मन्तव्योऽष्टगुणो रथः ।\nसत्यजित्समरश्लाघी द्रुपदस्यात्मजो युवा ॥","meaning":{"en":"And this valiant fighter, Satyajit, should be counted an eightfold chariot-warrior in battle; the young son of Drupada loves battle."}},{"n":23,"text":"गतः सोऽतिरथत्वं हि धृष्टद्युम्नेन संमितः ।\nपाण्डवानां यशस्कामः परं कर्म करिष्यति ॥","meaning":{"en":"He has reached atiratha rank, measured with Dhrishtadyumna; wishing for fame for the Pandavas he will do supreme deeds."}},{"n":24,"text":"अनुरक्तश्च शूरश्च रथोऽयमपरो महान् ।\nपाण्ड्यराजो महावीर्यः पाण्डवानां धुरंधरः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Another great chariot-warrior, loyal and brave, is the Pandya king of great valor, a load-bearer of the Pandavas."}},{"n":25,"text":"दृढधन्वा महेष्वासः पाण्डवानां रथोत्तमः ।\nश्रेणिमान्कौरवश्रेष्ठ वसुदानश्च पार्थिवः ।\nउभावेतावतिरथौ मतौ मम परंतप ॥","meaning":{"en":"Dridhadhanva, great archer, is among the best chariot-warriors of the Pandavas; Shrenimat, best of Kauravas, and King Vasudana: these two I count as atirathas, scorcher of foes."}}]}]}